---
---

<section id="contact" class="py-24 bg-[#eee8f8] relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#dfd8eb]">
  <!-- Soft aesthetic ambient glow -->
  <div class="absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-[#773be8]/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-[#ee4ca0]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Big Headline & Direct CTA -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#773be8] flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>05 — Hubungi Kami</span>
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ee4ca0]"></span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-[#211f24] tracking-tight leading-[0.94]">
          Rencanakan <br />
          <span class="text-[#773be8]">ceritamu.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-[#554e5d] text-base md:text-lg max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
          Punya rencana wisuda, kegiatan organisasi kampus, aksi panggung festival, atau momen berharga lainnya? Diskusikan konsep dan booking tanggalmu langsung dengan kami via WhatsApp tanpa ribet.
        </p>

        <!-- Direct Action Buttons -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Foto.in.id,%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20konsultasi%20dan%20booking%20sesi%20foto!" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="bg-[#773be8] hover:bg-[#622cc7] text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#773be8]/40 transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center gap-3 group cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Hubungi via WhatsApp</span>
            <span class="text-base leading-none group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">↗</span>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="https://instagram.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="bg-white/90 hover:bg-white text-[#211f24] border border-[#d8d4db] font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase px-7 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:border-[#773be8]"
          >
            <span>Instagram Foto.in.id</span>
            <span class="text-xs">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Note -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-[#71697a]">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Respon cepat aktif setiap hari (08.00 – 22.00 WIB)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Consultation Highlights / Value Cards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 border border-[#d8d4db] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#eee8f8] text-[#773be8] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
              ⚡
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#211f24] tracking-tight">
                Konsultasi Konsep Gratis
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#665f6e] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Bingung soal lokasi atau referensi pose? Tim kami siap berdiskusi moodboard dan memberikan rekomendasi terbaik.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 border border-[#d8d4db] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#eee8f8] text-[#773be8] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
              📅
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#211f24] tracking-tight">
                Penjadwalan Fleksibel
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#665f6e] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Sesuaikan tanggal dan waktu sesi foto dengan jadwal wisuda kampus, gladi resik, maupun agenda penting tim Anda.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 border border-[#d8d4db] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#eee8f8] text-[#773be8] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
              ✨
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#211f24] tracking-tight">
                Hasil Maksimal Tanpa Batasan
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#665f6e] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Semua file original diserahkan dalam resolusi penuh melalui cloud gallery privat tanpa kompresi kualitas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
